                                "sense_id": "978f62fb-cb97-34c1-9467-94b2849b1e3f",
                                "text": "[…] but its striking white trunk, which changes to a bright pink in late spring or summer just before it decorticates, makes it a handsome species."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "15c597d1-75f8-320a-b172-312f49f18243",
